          "guid": "mt3n9xm50k3za9vo",
          "message": {
            "text": "The computed CSS list must remain a CSS filter, not be lowered to hand-authored SVG primitives. Pinned Chromium 7d859f271cbda744098ac69f44978d4edfa62be3 builds operations in order, assigns CSS shorthand effects sRGB operating space and unclipped primitive bounds, and validates premultiplication before Skia; bare SVG primitives have different defaults. The nesting here also follows Blink paint-property ownership: local content is filtered before transform, then grouped opacity consumes that result. See the operation builder (0) and paint-property builder (1). tests/pseudo-filter-functions.e2e.test.ts independently rejects primitive lowering and a stripped-filter mutation.",
            "markdown": "The computed CSS list must remain a CSS filter, not be lowered to hand-authored SVG primitives. Pinned Chromium 7d859f271cbda744098ac69f44978d4edfa62be3 builds operations in order, assigns CSS shorthand effects sRGB operating space and unclipped primitive bounds, and validates premultiplication before Skia; bare SVG primitives have different defaults. The nesting here also follows Blink paint-property ownership: local content is filtered before transform, then grouped opacity consumes that result. See [the operation builder](0) and [paint-property builder](1). `tests/pseudo-filter-functions.e2e.test.ts` independently rejects primitive lowering and a stripped-filter mutation."
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "src/render/pseudo-filter.ts"
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 31,
                  "endLine": 63,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "/**\n * Apply the effects owned by a generated pseudo-element to its complete paint.\n *\n * Keep the computed CSS filter list intact instead of lowering it to SVG filter\n * primitives. Blink's FilterEffectBuilder applies the list in source order and\n * gives CSS shorthand functions sRGB operating space, unclipped primitive\n * bounds, and premultiplication validation. A hand-authored `<fe*>` graph would\n * otherwise inherit SVG's different defaults. The nesting mirrors Blink paint\n * property ownership: content -> filter -> transform -> opacity/primary effect.\n *\n * Source: Chromium 7d859f271cbda744098ac69f44978d4edfa62be3,\n * filter_effect_builder.cc and paint_property_tree_builder.cc.\n */\nexport function wrapPseudoPaintEffects(\n  box: PseudoPaintEffects,\n  content: string,\n): string {\n  let result = content;\n\n  const filter = box.filter?.trim();\n  if (filter && filter !== \"none\") {\n    result = `<g style=\"${esc(`filter:${filter}`)}\">${result}</g>`;\n  }\n\n  const transform = box.transform?.trim();\n  if (transform && transform !== \"none\") {\n    const [ox, oy] = transformOrigin(box.transformOrigin, box);\n    result = `<g transform=\"translate(${r(ox)} ${r(oy)}) ${esc(transform)} translate(${r(-ox)} ${r(-oy)})\">${result}</g>`;\n  }\n\n  if (box.opacity != null && Number.isFinite(box.opacity) && box.opacity < 1) {\n    result = `<g opacity=\"${String(Math.max(0, Math.min(1, box.opacity)))}\">${result}</g>`;\n  }"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          ],
